#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0325 expect=violation domain=TE
#note "Rows 1 and 2: same ETCD with the identical ELEMENT/TESTRL/TEENRL/TEDUR combination (full duplicate) -> the ETCD-keyed uniqueness check fires on both rows."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 2
#expectViolationAt row=1 ETCD=SCRN
#expectViolationAt row=2 ETCD=SCRN
dataset TE class="TRIAL DESIGN" label="Trial Elements"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ETCD    type=Char label="Element Code"
col ELEMENT type=Char label="Description of Element"
col TESTRL  type=Char label="Rule for Start of Element"
col TEENRL  type=Char label="Rule for End of Element"
col TEDUR   type=Char label="Planned Duration of Element"
---
S1 | TE | SCRN | Screening | Informed consent | Randomization    | P14D
S1 | TE | SCRN | Screening | Informed consent | Randomization    | P14D
S1 | TE | TRT  | Treatment | Randomization    | End of treatment | P28D
